  "discussion": "## Uninstall vsftpd Package\n\nThe `vsftpd` package can be removed with the following command: \n```\n $ sudo dnf remove vsftpd\n```\n\n**Rationale:**\n\nRemoving the `vsftpd` package decreases the risk of its\naccidental activation.",
